<title>UK: SWW makes 15 mln stg on Westcountry TV sale.</title>
<headline>SWW makes 15 mln stg on Westcountry TV sale.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>South West Water Plc said on Monday it has realised a net profit of 15 million stg from the sale of its 23 percent stake in Westcountry Television Ltd to Carlton Communications Plc.  </p>
<p>South West Water said the original investment did not involve any funds from the regulated utility, South West Water Services Ltd, or its customers.</p>
<p>Carlton has received irrevocable acceptances accounting for 77 percent of Westcountry's issued share capital. It made an agreed 85 million stg cash offer on Saturday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
